0..78 Comment "//! A capability a scope introduces lives in that scope\'s region, and its type"
79..158 Comment "//! says so: `Cap {exit} at c` is the capability living until the scope binding"
159..239 Comment "//! `c` ends. A region is a static extent, ordered by outlives and erased before"
240..320 Comment "//! anything runs [Koronkevich-2025-type_universes_kripke_worlds]: a value of an"
321..383 Comment "//! outer region may stand in an inner one, never the reverse."
384..387 Comment "//!"
388..448 Comment "//! - cites: [Koronkevich-2025-type_universes_kripke_worlds]"
